{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sweetie Candy Maze: Blueberry \u2014 is a colorful and fun maze game set in a world of juicy blueberry candies and sweet surprises. Collect all the sweets and find your way to the caramel portal to complete each level.<br><br>Each new maze brings more challenge and excitement as you explore deeper into the candy world!<br><br>In Sweetie Candy Maze: Blueberry:<br><br>\u2022 50 levels of candy-filled fun<br>\u2022 Bright and tasty visuals<br>\u2022 Gradually increasing difficulty<br>\u2022 Addictive and cheerful gameplay<br>\u2022 Relaxing music<br>\u2022 Achievements<br>\u2022 Simple controls<br><br>Use Gamepads (Xbox One or Xbox 360), or keyboard (WASD or arrow keys) to navigate through the different mazes!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4007850/extras/23589d8bed17e02ef837bd95406ffd51.poster.avif?t=1760537099\" width=75 height=70 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4007850/extras/23589d8bed17e02ef837bd95406ffd51.webm?t=1760537099\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4007850/extras/6c9c6cf3ddd10379eb0cf4ef3658ee09.poster.avif?t=1760537099\" width=75 height=69 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4007850/extras/6c9c6cf3ddd10379eb0cf4ef3658ee09.webm?t=1760537099\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4007850/extras/ed6eb4d4f3be5c28d15fdd23fa020353.poster.avif?t=1760537099\" width=75 height=70